      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a set of Python files for secret management using Microsoft/OpenAI. I need to create the following files:\n1. fetch_api_key.py - Fetches an API key from a managed secrets store.\n2. fetch_db_secret.py - Fetches a database connection secret at runtime.\n3. parse_json_secret.py - Retrieves and parses a JSON-formatted secret.\n4. rotate_secret_version.py - Reads a specific secret version or staged value.\n5. security_client.py - Provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Secret Management.\n6. security_models.py - Defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Secret Management.\n7. rotation_summary.py - Summarizes secret rotation status.\n8. secret_label_safety.py - Checks secret labels and notes for unsafe text.\n9. secret_audit_embedding.py - Embeds secret audit notes for semantic search.\n10. runbook_translate.py - Translates secret-rotation runbook notes.\n\nI will start by creating the fetch_api_key.py file, which will use Microsoft/OpenAI to fetch an API key from a managed secrets store. </thinking>\n",
